{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-frobenius-su2","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Example","doco:Section"],"label":"ex:frobenius-su2","kind":"example","title":"Frobenius relation for $\\mathrm{SU}(2)$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-frobenius-relation","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-qou-su2"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-frobenius-relation","tags":["su2","frobenius"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Examples.su2Frobenius","text":"frobenius-su2.md","leanSource":"frobenius-su2.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"ex:frobenius-su2\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A = \\mathcal{O}(\\mathrm{SU}(2))</code> equipped with pointwise multiplication <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mu(f \\otimes g) = fg</code>. The Frobenius form is the Haar integral <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\int_A = \\int_G</code>. The dual comultiplication is given by <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Delta_\\mu(f)(g,h) = \\int_G f(xg)\\overline{h(x)}dx</code>. The Frobenius relation precisely encodes the associativity of convolution: integrating <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">f(xy)g(y)</code> over <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">y</code> yields the same result whether convolved first with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">f</code> or first with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">g</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/frobenius-su2.md","heading":"Example","number":"4.2.1","page":"b/ex-frobenius-su2","qa":{"counts":{"pass":66,"fail":1,"warn":0,"na":7,"unknown":0,"stale":58},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Examples.su2Frobenius","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/frobenius-su2.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
